  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cambodia - Optimisation of the supply chain of solar/ biomass household energy systems</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With a DGGF Start-up Loan African Clean Energy B.V. (ACE) will be able to optimize and increase the production and sale of solar/biomass energy systems. Thanks to the loan from DGGF, ACE can improve its logistics efficiency by starting the supplies consolidation centre in Vietnam and generate impact. In addition, the company will start an assembly plant in Cambodia and perhaps also in Uganda, which may increase production.</narrative>
  </description>
